EITjXH8oxkQ7kNvwEJi3DF&_nc_oc=Adl80ES3EF9h6flVRc2X2ykWERp4seAQD_BCX9DO01CVNxlEgwHMv8FD3t33fXeEYEM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxCvPRAlcgj4cCfsvN1ltUCkzNp76NSOcK5fZIGCm7E7Q&oe=69BA90E0"}, {"file_name": "Tera's Explosion Screenshot.png", "id": "1227873799189844", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300619_1227873805856510_857672582019122498_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kwuTgbw9YsEQ7kNvwGhKqsO&_nc_oc=AdmKEF7XZ3JwsU-Orq6o1JqnyROM3oO8hS7zG92HMqQiNgrOcVIbVmJwOP8q1seFUfk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzqp_G0yyZfQjCuY570HM-grERSNTSZYt3DflavfnU8dA&oe=69BA909B"}, {"file_name": "VRShell Screenshot Mar 8 2025.png", "id": "1162526072228395", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819944_1162526075561728_3612483772541259477_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T2D2ScyJSBQQ7kNvwFKqhDJ&_nc_oc=Adnkct4s8l7zN-SKqmLcqM4AWpo2S1mAOtZbOi0z2Wrg0_sq1w7_OlSodXNvqZHvF7A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyyMpT1lXkIKsgAiX4lVJhebmWcDktNzSQk8sTmdF5lww&oe=69BAABCF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape copy.png", "id": "2818924551772944", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619187_2818924555106277_7406746174254493737_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HPLUTPExxaEQ7kNvwEyaPP8&_nc_oc=AdlWgSoL8yHRzc3N8Qtxn2kye0at8xyo98kO-P1si2reuJbfLa7z8sVWNsNpH-sXB2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy8gmOw8-gZz1Jt68IVl1voMNQ4V-QyN9oWAHRfUej4Ew&oe=69BA8848"}, "display_name": "Animal Company", "keywords": ["adventure", "social", "horror", "sandbox"], "long_description": "Animal Company is a FREE multiplayer social VR survival game on Meta Quest, where monsters, gadgets, and chaos with friends collide. With weekly updates, there\u2019s always something new to explore, unlock, or break.\n\n{1435323367926186}\n\n# Why Players Love Animal Company:\n\n\ud83d\udd2b Co-Op Survival & Monster Fights: \nTeam up with friends to explore haunted forests, secret research labs, icy mountain slopes, abandoned mines, low-gravity nuclear zones, lava caves, and frozen lakes \u2014 all controlled by the mysterious Canopy Group. You can play in random public servers or private servers.\n\n\ud83d\udedd Physics Toys, Tech Gadgets & Loot:\nUnlock powerful gadgets, sandbox toys, and rare loot. Craft and trade weapons, vehicles, drones, and robots, then level up using a deep Tech Tree that unlocks new abilities.\n\n{2941247836074738}\n\n\ud83d\ude0e Custom Animals & Skins:\nCreate your own animal character with unique body parts and drip fashion. Limited-time outfits and characters drop every two weeks.\n\n{872452332141625}\n\n\ud83d\udcf8 Meme-able & Stream-Ready Social Chaos\nScream, panic, or whisper using proximity chat and walkie-talkies while monsters hunt you down. Turn every game session into funny clips and short movies, or run your own mini-games, tournaments, or music concerts with friends to go viral on TikTok and YouTube.\n\n{1722468208476484}\n\n\ud83d\udc49 Join millions of players\nAnimal Company has one of the largest Discord communities in social VR, with on-going contests, quests, giveaways, developer events, and creator programs.\n\n{713760597862874}\n\nPlay Animal Company for FREE on Meta Quest today and experience nonstop social chaos with friends.", "short_description": "Animal Company is a FREE multiplayer social VR survival game on Meta Quest, where monsters, gadgets, and chaos with friends collide. With weekly updates, there\u2019s always something new to explore, unlock, or break."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.animalcompanyvr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.animalcompanyvr.com/terms", "publisher_name": "Wooster Games", "support_website_url": "https://discord.com/invite/animalcompany", "website_url": "https://a